<td>This template creates a virtual network with 2 subnets (server subnet and AzureFirewall subnet), A server VM, a client VM, a public IP address for each VM, and a route table to send traffic between VMs through the firewall.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-quickstart-templates/tree/master/quickstarts/microsoft.network/nat-gateway-hub-spoke-firewall" data-linktype="external">Hub-Spoke Network with NAT Gateway and Azure Firewall</a><br><br><a href="https://portal.azure.com/#create/Microsoft.Template/uri/https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FAzure%2Fazure-quickstart-templates%2Fmaster%2Fquickstarts%2Fmicrosoft.network%2Fnat-gateway-hub-spoke-firewall%2Fazuredeploy.json" data-linktype="external"><img src="../media/deploy-to-azure.svg" alt="Deploy to Azure" data-linktype="relative-path"></a></td>
